    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“我知道时间会改变很多事情，但我希望你我都能记住此刻的决定”</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是我的婚礼誓词，有人说很用心，我只能说坦诚而已，希望在《婚姻故事》里，我们都能及时观察到对方的情绪，也能毫无负担的做自己</span></p><span></span><p><span>「收听索引」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">0:34</a> 剧情简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">1:36</a> 拍摄手法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="247">4:07</a> 声音与色调</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">5:40</a> 剧本台词</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="573">9:33</a> 似曾相识的争吵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="844">14:04</a> 影片结局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1001">16:41</a> 一点点小心得</span></p>]]></description>
