  <item>
    <title>13.看了他才知道，什么叫心宽体胖</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c5bb6233591c27beb62d77</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c5bb6233591c27beb62d77</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 23 Aug 2024 08:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《处子之山》这部电影的标签虽说是爱情，但在我看来更多的却是关于自我价值的探讨，不是所有人都只会依赖外在力量才能获得内心的成长与飞跃，它鼓励人们能够在自己沉溺的环境中跳脱出来，在希望面前勇于尝试，在困苦面前保持钝感，最终通过自身的力量去翻越心中的那一座座大山。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「收听索引」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">0:15</a> 片名的由来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="57">0:57</a> 舞蹈课外的偶遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="425">7:05</a> 跌宕起伏的感情线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="909">15:09</a> 怯懦与果敢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1089">18:09</a> 憨态可掬与心细如发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1259">20:59</a> 自卑与自强</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1602">26:42</a> 风格化调色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1649">27:29</a> 逻辑严密的剧情</span></p><span></span><p><span>bgm：处子之山-吴含</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lp2Qr040rYN30debWBqQk_Qo3n_5.m4a" length="59935431" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:31:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhdktlCyk6BcM_V1YGbRy83pWzKQ.png"/>
