  <item>
    <title>12.走走停停，都是寻常</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b5f46ddb5e6d6bf9204c96</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b5f46ddb5e6d6bf9204c96</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 09 Aug 2024 10:50:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>成功的人不代表就是金子，失败的人也不一定就是屎！每个人的成长之路都伴随着他人无法窥探的代价，情感的牺牲，梦想的搁置，自我认同的挣扎，每一步前行都镌刻着不为人知的努力和放弃，终其一生，唯有自渡。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「收听索引」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">1:05</a> 剧情简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="377">6:17</a> 反套路式家庭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">9:50</a> 那些意外的反转</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="733">12:13</a> 父亲对于拍电影的态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="902">15:02</a> 一再紧扣的主题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1049">17:29</a> 母亲的遗憾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1191">19:51</a> 何为真实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1393">23:13</a> 浅聊一下演技</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1762">29:22</a> 开篇与结尾</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpaO6FItwE4xaEtBA_ccJ_ePCu4l.m4a" length="64105598" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:33:11</itunes:duration>
