    <guid isPermaLink="false">66acf46a33ddcbb53cea8689</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 02 Aug 2024 14:59:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>对于国内的军事题材电影来说，《红海行动》无疑树立了一个高标准和榜样。它不仅在技术上有非常大的突破和创新，还在内容上深入挖掘和呈现了人性的光辉与复杂。据悉，这部电影的续篇有可能会以大换血的阵容出现在25年的春节档，或许能超越林超贤的就只有他自己了，狠狠期待！</span></p><span></span><p><span>「收听索引」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="27">0:27</a> 剧情简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">1:24</a> “蛟龙突击队”的救援行动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="252">4:12</a> 反战势力和政治环境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="507">8:27</a> 夏楠在影片中的作用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="962">16:02</a> 蛟龙小队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1346">22:26</a> 导演的冷处理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1439">23:59</a> 战争中的人性光辉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1553">25:53</a> 守护和平与安宁</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnJl3rH6v17krf7OQU7-XaxecnHr.m4a" length="52181563" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:27:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhdktlCyk6BcM_V1YGbRy83pWzKQ.png"/>
