  <item>
    <title>08.少年派的奇幻漂流，相信纯真的力量</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668cbfeeae8e21859a881943</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668cbfeeae8e21859a881943</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 12 Jul 2024 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>录着录着帕克与派克傻傻分不清楚了sorry……</span></p><span></span><p><span>整部影片印象最深刻的一段话是，中年派说自己最难过的不是经历了如此之多的磨难，而是没能在所有失去发生之前与其好好告别。但好在，一无所有的他仍然愿意相信纯真，最终收获了新的家庭与责任。那么，在还来得及的时候，请拥抱彼此，好好告别，期待浪漫的再见。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「收听索引」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">0:51</a> 剧情简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">1:12</a> 成长背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">5:11</a> 货轮起航</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">6:00</a> 人是否需要信仰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="467">7:47</a> 船难骤起，艰难求生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="866">14:26</a> 驯服帕克</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> 偶遇无人岛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 重返人间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1395">23:15</a> 另外一个故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1573">26:13</a> 每个人心里都有老虎与少年</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/libJqPVtxzE4aspr7P-a9rwM8piK.m4a" length="54155039" type="audio/mp4"/>
