  <item>
    <title>07.控方证人，反转再反转！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6687b06f0bc5d7cc700adec2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6687b06f0bc5d7cc700adec2</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Jul 2024 08:35:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这部是迄今为止仅仅通过剧情和演技就让我频频惊呼，瞪大双眼，每到高能片段总会忍不住来回细品，最后用浑身的鸡皮疙瘩进行收尾，总结起来就是越看越麻，越看越刺激的口碑佳作。</span></p><span></span><p><span>炎炎夏日，让人逐渐眩晕的上班路上蝉声争鸣，请用这部电影来倒吸一口凉气吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>「收听索引」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">0:15</a> 观看契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="57">0:57</a> 傲娇爵士与精明护工</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">3:49</a> 被指控的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="394">6:34</a> 杀人动机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="512">8:32</a> 态度暧昧的沃尔夫人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="729">12:09</a> 管家太太</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="956">15:56</a> 最后的控方证人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1092">18:12</a> 陌生女人的来电</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1144">19:04</a> 反转再反转</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1277">21:17</a> 道义与温情</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhcJMt_H_Spm8qDVPqFiX11AK1Nh.m4a" length="46756238" type="audio/mp4"/>
