  <item>
    <title>06.饮食男女，人之大欲</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667e1cb0c37399840ca28d76</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667e1cb0c37399840ca28d76</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Jun 2024 02:15:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是我最喜欢的描述家庭、情感和欲望的一部电影，我相信任何人都能在其中找到自己或者身边人的影子，我们能被里面的美食与生活吸引，也能被幽深又富有激情的关系所震撼</span></p><span></span><p><span>最终，我们会带着理解与释怀在生活中继续</span></p><span></span><p><span>「收听索引」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">0:28</a> 剧情简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">1:35</a> 影片基调</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="204">3:24</a> 扑朔的亲友关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="463">7:43</a> 三姐妹的感情线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="921">15:21</a> 老朋友去世</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1029">17:09</a> 坦白一切</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1305">21:45</a> 有待挖掘的情感意趣</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：Ennio Morricone-Playing Love(Piano Version)</span></p>]]></description>
