    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>勺子的两层含义：一是指喝汤盛饭用的</span><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/81891?fromModule=lemma_inlink" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/81891?fromModule=lemma_inlink"><span>工具</span></a><span>；二是形容一个人很傻，西北方言。本片自然适用于第二种</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望好人再无烦恼，而恶人自有好人磨~</span></p><span></span><p><span>「收听索引」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">1:16</a> 剧情简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">5:15</a> 逐渐“勺”化的几个阶段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">7:22</a> 守护勺子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="682">11:22</a> 成为勺子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="923">15:23</a> 第二组对照</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1493">24:53</a> 三段式拍摄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1573">26:13</a> 身边的拉条子</span></p>]]></description>
