  <item>
    <title>02.我的阿勒泰，比草原更广袤的是人心（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66588b3494977a26ef0f189b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66588b3494977a26ef0f189b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 31 May 2024 08:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>阿勒泰的剧情一直是舒缓平和的，没想到在最后会给我直击灵魂的深刻。剧集会结束，可那片土地会生生不息，也许没有人能够抵挡时代的洪流，但那里的山川、松林、羊群、草地会告诉你——</span></p><span></span><p><span>不管世事如何变化，斗转星移，内心的自由才是永恒的主题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「收听索引」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">2:56</a> 文秀和巴太</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a> 婚礼上的确认</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="894">14:54</a> 苏力坦的沉默</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1034">17:14</a> 高晓亮的出走</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1469">24:29</a> 父子和解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1604">26:44</a> 古尔邦的献祭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1913">31:53</a> 阿勒泰的结局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> 耐人寻味的细节</span></p><span></span><p><span>bgm：草原的风/李文秀-高小阳</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmdp4ErQ71m4ht1rAgT-VJf40ZLp.m4a" length="73004099" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhdktlCyk6BcM_V1YGbRy83pWzKQ.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>2</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>01.我的阿勒泰，比草原更广袤的是人心（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/664f639e4efbc0c3dca16641</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">664f639e4efbc0c3dca16641</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 23 May 2024 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>首期播客遇见阿勒泰，是我的幸运。</span></p><span></span><p><span>每次看到没那么千篇一律的剧情，总喜欢写写画画，现在回头看，里面的很多人物看似自由，却也都承载着强烈的宿命感。广袤的阿勒泰，看谁能冲破执念与枷锁，一路向前。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「收听索引」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">0:14</a> 自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="194">3:14</a> 剧情简介和背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="248">4:08</a> 文秀在乌市打工</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="458">7:38</a> 回到阿勒泰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 谁给我安全感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="813">13:33</a> 小卖铺母女和苏力坦一家的正面交锋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 自由自在的便好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1026">17:06</a> 仙女湾的传说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1261">21:01</a> 托肯和朝戈的婚事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1480">24:40</a> 再次遇见高晓亮</span></p><span></span><p><span>bgm：草原的风/李文秀-高小阳</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnjjh4IHBjJtbrLtseM8_JCMrc7X.m4a" length="58668551" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:30:22</itunes:duration>
